W32: Shell IPC and event extensions (0.2.7)

Date: 2026-11-25
Agent: agy (Gemini)
Branch: dev
Version: 0.2.7

SUMMARY

  Extended tam-pane's IPC protocol and event stream to support Tamlinux
  0.7.0 Milestone 5 (connecting the Quickshell compositor facade to
  tam-pane):
  - Bumped VERSION to 0.2.7.
  - Added `dpms=<0|1>` and `description=<escaped>` fields to `monitors`
    IPC output.
  - Added `keyboards` IPC query listing seat keyboards (`name`, `layout`,
    `active_keymap`, `active_layout_index`, `main`).
  - Added `dispatch dpms <on|off> <output>` sharing `tp_output_power_set`
    with `zwlr_output_power_manager_v1` (preserving the nested-Wayland
    OFF guard).
  - Added `dispatch focus_app <name>`, `dispatch keyboard next [name]`,
    and optional `[monitor]` targeting for `dispatch tag view` and
    `dispatch tag toggle_view`.
  - Added subscribable events `monitor.focus`, `output.power`,
    `keyboard.layout`, and `config.reload` (also wired into Lua hooks).

